{"id":"1bd3c80fee07619a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-variable.md","title":"Variable","display":"df-variable — Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-variable","aliases":["92-df-variable"],"display":"df-variable — Variable","depends_on":["[[92-df-signature]]"],"source":"本地算术语法；对照原书第 II 章 pp.14–19 和第 III 章 pp.28–30；本库 token 编码及 Hilbert 呈现与原书原生语言不同","source_status":"原书相关概念的本地语法实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-variable — Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地算术语法；对照原书第 II 章 pp.14–19 和第 III 章 pp.28–30；本库 token 编码及 Hilbert 呈现与原书原生语言不同"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关概念的本地语法实现"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-variable-—-Variable-$x$\">df-variable — Variable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> (signature of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable-symbol set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Sigma_G\">\\(x\\in\\Sigma_G\\)</span> (symbol token)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VarSym}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{VarSym}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{VarSym}_G(x) \\leftrightarrow x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{VarSym}_G(x) \\leftrightarrow x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VarSym}_G(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{VarSym}_G(x)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的变量符号</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> : 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a> 定义的变量符号集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,v_1,v_2,\\ldots\">\\(v_0,v_1,v_2,\\ldots\\)</span> : 变量（有时记为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>变量用于构造公式和项</li>\n<li>自由变量 vs 约束变量</li>\n<li>变量符号集的可数性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a> 中的枚举给出</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-variable-—-Variable-$x$","text":"df-variable — Variable $x$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3